    <item>
      <title>Version 1.1</title>
      <pubDate>Mon, 26 Oct 2026 04:41:17 GMT</pubDate>
      <sparkle:version>4</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.1</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description><![CDATA[<h2>Tapformat 1.1</h2>
<ul>
<li><b>A cinematic welcome.</b> It teaches you the shortcut by having you press it, and sets everything up in one pass.</li>
<li><b>Your own shortcut.</b> Keep ⇧⌘ or record anything: a tap like ⌃⇧, or keys like ⌥Space.</li>
<li><b>Drag &amp; drop.</b> Drop files on the Tapformat window and the ring opens.</li>
<li><b>Finds your file.</b> The converted file is selected in Finder as soon as it is ready.</li>
<li><b>Fewer folder prompts.</b> Desktop, Documents and Downloads are asked for in one go.</li>
<li><b>New Settings and menu bar.</b> Everything in one place, with a count of the files you have converted.</li>
</ul>]]></description>
