      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description><![CDATA[<h2>Tapformat 1.0.1</h2>
<ul>
<li><b>Now notarized by Apple.</b> No more "can't verify this app" warning.</li>
<li><b>Send Feedback…</b> in the menu bar menu and in Settings.</li>
<li><b>A cleaner installer.</b></li>
</ul>
<p>After updating, macOS may ask you to turn on Accessibility for Tapformat again (System Settings → Privacy &amp; Security → Accessibility). It's a one-time step because of the new Apple signature.</p>]]></description>
